{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860203979526635552","content":"She nods. \"First, I'll ask if you have an offering you feel is equal to the reward. I have a few ideas myself but I always like to hear what my guests think.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T20:48:50.186000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864609339436302342","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860203979526635552","content":"\"I have little but gold and essence, if such things are still on my body. But I doubt what you are asking for is material.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T20:49:55.719000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864609614301757481","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860203979526635552","content":"\"If I had to guess, service?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T20:50:48.763000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864609836783370302","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860203979526635552","content":"\"Correct. Payment here is more... abstract and less... material.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T20:51:03.172000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864609897218965535","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860203979526635552","content":"\"For instance, you could give me some of your vitality (some years off your life+your horns) or even some of your strength (-2 from strength)\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T20:52:53.340000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864610359297703976","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860203979526635552","content":"\"For your life back you must sacrifice something important to you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T20:53:14.146000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864610446563999754","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860203979526635552","content":"\"If you are asking for what I value...freedom from others, and the strength of my destiny.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T20:53:26.120000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864610496785940520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860203979526635552","content":"\"This is a part of your destiny.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T20:54:31.515000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864610771072450630","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860203979526635552","content":"\"Live less long but still strong and capable, or live equally as long but not as heroically strong.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T20:55:41.997000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T20:55:54.305000Z","id":"864611066696695810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
